<title>UK: Simon Engineering profits similar to yr-ago.</title>
<headline>Simon Engineering profits similar to yr-ago.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Simon Engineering Plc said on Monday its profits so far this year had been similar to 1996.</p>
</text>
